    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "eugr's (Eugene Rakhmatulin) spark-vllm-docker recipe for NVIDIA's Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4 (ModelOpt NVFP4, Apache-2.0; checkpoint revision 1355db6a) served by vLLM on single Spark. Runs eugr's published vllm-node image (nightly-20260929, digest pinned; its build-metadata records spark-vllm-docker 42f62e34, vLLM 0.30.1rc1.dev336+gaf5b4857e and FlashInfer 4a638133) with upstream's launch: Marlin MoE backend (VLLM_MARLIN_USE_ATOMIC_ADD=1), FlashInfer attention, FP8 KV cache, fastsafetensors loading, chunked prefill, async scheduling, prefix caching, qwen3 reasoning and qwen3_xml tool parsing, 262,144-token context, four sequences, 8,192 batched tokens and memory utilisation 0.4 (upstream defaults). MTP with three speculative tokens is the default; an option selects eugr's no-MTP recipe instead. Upstream's recipe is written for two Sparks; eugr's --solo mode runs the same command at tensor parallel 1 (the only override), which is this single-Spark recipe. No upstream performance claims are recorded. Upstream repository MIT. Physical Spark acceptance is pending.",
